-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 3, §3.1 יחידת עבודה
-- The elementary-school teacher's unit of work: 30 weekly hours in grades
-- 1-6, 24 in grades 7-8, and how a teacher who moves from grades 7-8 to 1-6
-- keeps the 7-8 base for some of her hours.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `3.1 יחידת עבודה`

DECLARE `3.1 party` IS ONE OF
    `a takanon party` HAS `who` IS A Party

DECLARE `reform action` IS ONE OF
    `transfer the teacher to the junior high school` HAS `hours transferred` IS A NUMBER
    `try to place the teacher in grades 7-8 elsewhere`
    `pay on the 4ב.2 key`

@desc A teacher who moved from grades 7-8 to grades 1-6, as far as section 3.1 asks about it.
DECLARE `moving teacher` HAS
    `years in grades 7-8 among the last 17`      IS A NUMBER  @desc junior high included, continuous or not; a training-fund sabbatical year counts per what was paid (3)
    `taught grades 7-8 in one of the last 7 years` IS A BOOLEAN
    `average 7-8 hours over the last 10 such years` IS A NUMBER @desc training-grant hours included where 3א-ב allow
    `average 7-8 hours over the last 3 years`    IS A NUMBER
    `weekly hours now taught in grades 1-6`      IS A NUMBER

§§ `1-2 The unit`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_1
`weekly hours in an elementary unit (grades 1-6)` MEANS 30

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_2
`weekly hours in a grade 7-8 unit` MEANS 24

GIVEN `hours in grades 1-6` IS A NUMBER, `hours in grades 7-8` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `position fraction` `hours in grades 1-6` `hours in grades 7-8` IS
        `hours in grades 1-6` DIVIDED BY `weekly hours in an elementary unit (grades 1-6)`
    PLUS `hours in grades 7-8` DIVIDED BY `weekly hours in a grade 7-8 unit`

-- Hours of grades 1-6 paid at the 7-8 base up to a protected number, the
-- rest at the 1-6 base.
GIVEN `hours taught` IS A NUMBER, `protected hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `fraction with protected hours` `hours taught` `protected hours` IS
    `position fraction` (`hours taught` MINUS min `hours taught` `protected hours`) (min `hours taught` `protected hours`)

§§ `3 Keeping the 7-8 base`

-- 3: ten years or more in grades 7-8 of the last 17, and one of the last 7:
-- on moving to grades 1-6 the base of the position does not change, the
-- hours of entitlement being the average of the last ten years in 7-8.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_3
GIVEN t IS A `moving teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `keeps the base under 3.1.3` t IF
        t's `years in grades 7-8 among the last 17` AT LEAST 10
    AND t's `taught grades 7-8 in one of the last 7 years`

GIVEN t IS A `moving teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `fraction under 3.1.3` t IS
    `fraction with protected hours` (t's `weekly hours now taught in grades 1-6`) (t's `average 7-8 hours over the last 10 such years`)

-- 3 ¶2: training-grant hours count in that average only if (א) they were
-- deducted from the position rather than added to it, and (ב) they were paid
-- on the 7-8 base.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_3/p2
GIVEN `deducted from the position` IS A BOOLEAN, `paid on the 7-8 base` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `training-grant hours count` `deducted from the position` `paid on the 7-8 base` IF
    `3.1.3א` `deducted from the position` AND `3.1.3ב` `paid on the 7-8 base`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_3__subpara_a
GIVEN `deducted from the position` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `3.1.3א` `deducted from the position` IF `deducted from the position`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_3__subpara_b
GIVEN `paid on the 7-8 base` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `3.1.3ב` `paid on the 7-8 base` IF `paid on the 7-8 base`

§§ `4 Teachers moved by the reform`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_4 The label of clause 4; its footnote marker (5) points at the source list.

-- 4א: where the reform moved a school's grades to a junior high school, the
-- Ministry must transfer the teachers who taught 7-8 there in the last three
-- years to the junior high school, for the same hours; failing that, they
-- are paid under 4ב.2.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_4__subpara_a
GIVEN `hours taught in 7-8` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.1 party` `reform action`
DECIDE `transfer to the junior high school` `hours taught in 7-8` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `transfer the teacher to the junior high school` h PROVIDED h AT LEAST `hours taught in 7-8`
    LEST  (PARTY `a takanon party` `the employer`
           MUST  `pay on the 4ב.2 key`
           LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the employer` BECAUSE "3.1.4א: a teacher not transferred is paid under 4ב.2")

-- 4ב: "such teachers whom the Ministry is not bound to transfer": 4א binds
-- it for those who worked in grades 7-8 there in (all of) the last three
-- years, so 4ב's are the reform school's teachers who taught 7-8 in only part
-- of them — whose 4ב.2 average then counts the years without 7-8 as nought.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_4__subpara_b
GIVEN `in a school the reform moved` IS A BOOLEAN, `years of the last three in grades 7-8` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ministry is bound to transfer her` `in a school the reform moved` `years of the last three in grades 7-8` IF
    `in a school the reform moved` AND `years of the last three in grades 7-8` EQUALS 3

GIVEN `in a school the reform moved` IS A BOOLEAN, `years of the last three in grades 7-8` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a 4ב teacher` `in a school the reform moved` `years of the last three in grades 7-8` IF
        `in a school the reform moved`
    AND `years of the last three in grades 7-8` GREATER THAN 0
    AND `years of the last three in grades 7-8` LESS THAN 3

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.1 party` `reform action`
DECIDE `an effort to place her in 7-8 elsewhere` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `try to place the teacher in grades 7-8 elsewhere`
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "3.1.4ב.1: an effort is made to place her in grades 7-8 in other schools"

-- 4ב.2: not placed, she is paid for teaching grades 1-6 as follows: the
-- average hours she taught in 7-8 over the last three years on the 24-hour
-- base, the rest on the 30-hour base.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_2__para_4__subpara_b__cls_2
GIVEN t IS A `moving teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `fraction under 3.1.4ב.2` t IS
    `fraction with protected hours` (t's `weekly hours now taught in grades 1-6`) (t's `average 7-8 hours over the last 3 years`)

-- F-3.1-a: a teacher the reform moved to grades 1-6 who has ten years of
-- 7-8 in the last 17 meets both 3 and 4ב.2, and they protect different
-- averages. The reading adopted: 3 — the later agreement (1993-94), which
-- says the base does not change — governs where its conditions are met.
@export default The position fraction of a teacher who moved from grades 7-8 to grades 1-6, under section 3.1 of the takanon
GIVEN t IS A `moving teacher` @desc the teacher
      `moved by the reform and not placed in 7-8` IS A BOOLEAN @desc 4ב.2 applies to her
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `fraction after the move` t `moved by the reform and not placed in 7-8` IS
    IF `keeps the base under 3.1.3` t
    THEN `fraction under 3.1.3` t
    ELSE IF `moved by the reform and not placed in 7-8`
         THEN `fraction under 3.1.4ב.2` t
         ELSE `position fraction` (t's `weekly hours now taught in grades 1-6`) 0

`a reform-moved teacher with twelve years of 7-8` MEANS
    `moving teacher` WITH
        `years in grades 7-8 among the last 17`      IS 12
        `taught grades 7-8 in one of the last 7 years` IS TRUE
        `average 7-8 hours over the last 10 such years` IS 24
        `average 7-8 hours over the last 3 years`    IS 12
        `weekly hours now taught in grades 1-6`      IS 30

`3 and 4ב.2 price the same teacher differently` MEANS
        `keeps the base under 3.1.3` `a reform-moved teacher with twelve years of 7-8`
    AND NOT `fraction under 3.1.3` `a reform-moved teacher with twelve years of 7-8`
            EQUALS `fraction under 3.1.4ב.2` `a reform-moved teacher with twelve years of 7-8`
#ASSERT `3 and 4ב.2 price the same teacher differently`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_3 The heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_3__para_1 A source: section 10 of the agreement of 29.8.69 and the circulars that followed.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_3__para_2 A source: special director-general's circular ד' 5737, section 11.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_3__para_3 A source: collective agreement of 11.5.93 and parity committee decisions of 7.9.93 and 18.9.94.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_3__para_4 A source: decision of the accountancy and the conditions-of-service head of 23.6.98.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_1__hc_3__para_5 A source: the deputy director-general's letter of 2.3.79 and the agreements of 22.2.79 and 26.5.81.

-- Worked examples.
#ASSERT `position fraction` 15 12 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `fraction under 3.1.3` `a reform-moved teacher with twelve years of 7-8` EQUALS 1.2
#ASSERT `fraction under 3.1.4ב.2` `a reform-moved teacher with twelve years of 7-8` EQUALS 1.1
#TRACE `transfer to the junior high school` 12 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education` DOES `transfer the teacher to the junior high school` 12 AT 1
